  "body": "When Chromium prompts users to choose a device, the list of available devices may change while the prompt is active. The current wording of the proposal doesn't appear to support this behavior, because [it invokes the Permission API's \"prompt the user to choose\" with a static set of Bluetooth devices](https://github.com/WebBluetoothCG/web-bluetooth/blob/7b56ee87ffd57d22ae8d12ba4ddd7b94aeb996c5/index.bs#L1479-L1492).",
